  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Immersive_Pixelmon/BH_Immersive_Pixelmon_header.webp\" width=\"1004\" height=\"323\"></span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Immersive Pixelmon 是一個旨在將 Pixelmon 模組擴展到極致的整合包，讓遊戲體驗變得更加身歷其境。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">為此，我們融入了眾多模組，旨在讓玩家完全沉浸於遊戲之中，例如著名的遠天地平線（Distant Horizons），以及眾多其他模組。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Immersive_Pixelmon/BH_Immersive_Pixelmon_description.webp\" width=\"1004\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">遊戲的目標是讓你能體驗最接近原版 Minecraft 的感覺，同時加入許多附加模組，讓遊玩 Pixelmon 更加有趣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">此外，地形</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">也已進行修改，同時加入了大量與 Pixelmon 完美契合的模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🔊 透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>AmbientSounds 6</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sound Physics Remastered</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visuality-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Visuality Reforged</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Falling Leaves</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-real-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Snow! Real Magic!</strong></span></a> 體驗身歷其境的氛圍，並搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Combat</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Not Enough Animations</strong></span></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Third Person</strong></span></a> 帶來更生動的動畫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🍎 透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Farmer&rsquo;s Delight</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ocean&rsquo;s Delight</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Nether&rsquo;s Delight</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ender&rsquo;s Delight</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooking-for-blockheads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Cooking for Blockheads</strong></span></a> 擴展生存體驗，並透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archeological\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Archeological</strong></span></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Archeology</strong></span></a> 探索考古學。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🧑🏻‍🤝‍🧑🏼 非常適合多人連線遊玩，支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Simple Voice Chat</strong></span></a> 等模組、優化附加元件、光影以及與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Distant Horizons</strong></span></a> 的相容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Immersive_Pixelmon/BH_Immersive_Pixelmon_promo2.webp\" width=\"1004\" height=\"180\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找能與朋友一起玩任何整合包的伺服器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 就是你的最佳解答！他們提供最高 CP 值的 Minecraft 伺服器，若你點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此連結</strong></a>，即可使用代碼「Lupin」享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Immersive_Pixelmon/BH_Immersive_Pixelmon_faq.webp\" width=\"1004\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>Minecraft 一直載入中？進入世界後 FPS 卻很低嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">請務必確認是否需要<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmundominecraft.net%252fen%252fallocate-more-ram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">增加記憶體（RAM）</a></strong>，大多數問題都是因此而起。如果你使用的是 CurseForge 應用程式，操作很簡單：點選個人資料選項，取消勾選「使用系統預設記憶體」，並將滑桿向右拉動（建議至少設定為 8GB 或 8192 MB）。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果發現仍然不夠，請繼續增加記憶體！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你的伺服器出現錯誤了嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">很遺憾地，當你自己架設伺服器，或聘請我未推薦的虛擬主機時，這個整合包可能無法正常運作。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個整合包在<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></strong> 上運作完美，因此我 100% 推薦選擇該主機服務。此外，透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dimmersivepixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>購買並使用代碼「Lupin」即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請注意，本整合包建議最低配置 8GB 記憶體。如果玩家人數較多，建議進一步增加記憶體容量。</span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Immersive_Pixelmon/BH_Immersive_Pixelmon_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1004\" height=\"95\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1243/778/immersive-pixelmon-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2030\" height=\"1142\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1322/141/immersive-pixelmon-3-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2030\" height=\"1085\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1322/143/immersive-pixelmon-5-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2030\" height=\"1085\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
